<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xml:lang="en-US"><voice name="en-US-EmmaMultilingualNeural"><prosody rate="-10%">Number eighteen.</prosody><break time="1150ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-EmmaMultilingualNeural"><prosody rate="-10%">When Sofia moved into her new apartment,<break time="80ms"/> she planned to put a desk beside the window.<break time="150ms"/> However,<break time="80ms"/> the afternoon sunlight made her computer screen difficult to see.<break time="150ms"/> She considered buying thicker curtains,<break time="80ms"/> but they would make the room too dark.<break time="150ms"/> In the end,<break time="80ms"/> she placed the desk against another wall and kept the window area open for plants.</prosody><break time="1100ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-EmmaMultilingualNeural"><prosody rate="-10%">Question.</prosody><break time="350ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-EmmaMultilingualNeural"><prosody rate="-10%">What did Sofia finally decide to do?</prosody></voice></speak>
